      "content": "\"letting go of the obligation\"... that's exactly it. it's like i'm constantly performing this version of a person that doesn't exist. and it's so exhausting. if i'm not actually a good person, then what's the point of even trying to stay? if the only thing i'm doing is wasting space and pretending, isn't it actually more honest to just... stop?",
